OL,3,GNEWSAWoman and girl arrested after
OL,4,Awrong-way crash on M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fa car being driven the wrong way hit
OL,8,Fhis vehicle on the M1 near Wakefield.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said a blue Kia
OL,11,FProceed had failed to stop for police
OL,12,Fand was being driven the wrong way up
OL,13,Fthe northbound carriageway, where it
OL,14,Fstruck a red Dacia Sandero shortly
OL,15,Fafter 23:00 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Dacia, a man in his
OL,18,F20s, was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Fpotentially life-changing injuries.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
