OL,3,GNEWSAWoman and girl arrested after
OL,4,Awrong-way crash on M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people - an 18-year-old man, a
OL,7,F15-year-old girl and a 30-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman - have been arrested for causing
OL,9,Finjury by dangerous driving. One other
OL,10,Fperson fled the scene.
